    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/02651dd3f6ff90f9345873919d52e2a0.webp?t=1749234554\" width=640 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, government and private agencies launch manned moon missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an astronaut on a routine rotation at an underground base. As you prepare to relieve your colleague, nothing goes as planned. The Moon is not ready for us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/6d46710db967d8ceae6659d8e44ff78d.poster.avif?t=1749234554\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/6d46710db967d8ceae6659d8e44ff78d.webm?t=1749234554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/6d46710db967d8ceae6659d8e44ff78d.mp4?t=1749234554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey spans serene moon plains to intense, action-packed tight spots\u2014from cold corridors to vast open-world landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you piece together your escape, explore optional paths and discover the Moon isn\u2019t as abandoned as it seems. Your trusty rover will carry you across the wastelands until it\u2019s time to go on foot and explore exciting locations - from crashed vessels to abandoned research facilities -  at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/837f0f814ce01bbac9ef6e3014d34b99.poster.avif?t=1749234554\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/837f0f814ce01bbac9ef6e3014d34b99.webm?t=1749234554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/837f0f814ce01bbac9ef6e3014d34b99.mp4?t=1749234554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, many courses of action are required. Solving puzzles until you need to dodge a war missile, trawling through cramped corridors until you have full freedom to explore the vast peaceful surroundings - but dangerous things remain forgotten beneath the tranquil planes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you will travel vast distances, land shuttles, help new acquaintances, navigate through caverns with a radar device, hack cameras, propel yourself across a valley and mess with explosives. You will gain many devices but the most important tool you have are your wits to get you off the rock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sea of Tranquility is a first-person sci-fi adventure that combines open world exploration, puzzles and action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various puzzles</strong> - land shuttles, control cameras, optimize energy flows and hack numerous devices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced action</strong> - outsmart deadly security systems, avoid a war missile - not everything is abandoned on the Moon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Moon landscapes</strong> you can explore on foot and with a vehicle open world style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear progression</strong> \u2013 explore at your pace, find upgrades, and unlock alternate endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/992a11f6f1e907d7edba39c217f2a305.webp?t=1749234554\" width=640 height=54 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/02651dd3f6ff90f9345873919d52e2a0.webp?t=1749234554\" width=640 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, government and private agencies launch manned moon missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an astronaut on a routine rotation at an underground base. As you prepare to relieve your colleague, nothing goes as planned. The Moon is not ready for us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/6d46710db967d8ceae6659d8e44ff78d.poster.avif?t=1749234554\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/6d46710db967d8ceae6659d8e44ff78d.webm?t=1749234554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/6d46710db967d8ceae6659d8e44ff78d.mp4?t=1749234554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey spans serene moon plains to intense, action-packed tight spots\u2014from cold corridors to vast open-world landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you piece together your escape, explore optional paths and discover the Moon isn\u2019t as abandoned as it seems. Your trusty rover will carry you across the wastelands until it\u2019s time to go on foot and explore exciting locations - from crashed vessels to abandoned research facilities -  at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/837f0f814ce01bbac9ef6e3014d34b99.poster.avif?t=1749234554\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/837f0f814ce01bbac9ef6e3014d34b99.webm?t=1749234554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/837f0f814ce01bbac9ef6e3014d34b99.mp4?t=1749234554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, many courses of action are required. Solving puzzles until you need to dodge a war missile, trawling through cramped corridors until you have full freedom to explore the vast peaceful surroundings - but dangerous things remain forgotten beneath the tranquil planes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you will travel vast distances, land shuttles, help new acquaintances, navigate through caverns with a radar device, hack cameras, propel yourself across a valley and mess with explosives. You will gain many devices but the most important tool you have are your wits to get you off the rock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sea of Tranquility is a first-person sci-fi adventure that combines open world exploration, puzzles and action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various puzzles</strong> - land shuttles, control cameras, optimize energy flows and hack numerous devices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced action</strong> - outsmart deadly security systems, avoid a war missile - not everything is abandoned on the Moon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Moon landscapes</strong> you can explore on foot and with a vehicle open world style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear progression</strong> \u2013 explore at your pace, find upgrades, and unlock alternate endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784750/extras/992a11f6f1e907d7edba39c217f2a305.webp?t=1749234554\" width=640 height=54 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Escape your doomed mission from the Moon. Explore a vast open-world landscape and evade its dangers. Land shuttles, solve puzzles, control cameras, hack systems, uncover mysteries, and roam tranquil plains in your Rover. Survive the mission. Make your escape.",
